      "url": "https://sjcc.org/event/sound-bath-for-a-new-year/",
      "title": "Sound Bath for a New Year",
      "description": "<p>Join the J for a restorative sound bath experience led by local yoga instructor Ben Blustein. Through the soothing vibrations of crystal singing bowls and guided meditation, you&#8217;ll have the opportunity to quiet your mind, relax your body and renew your spirit as we prepare for the Jewish New Year.</p>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re seeking reflection, relaxation, or simply a peaceful pause, this immersive experience offers a meaningful way to enter the season with intention, balance and renewal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sjcc.my.site.com/s/registration?courseSessionId=a18V4000012xWNDIA2&amp;courseOptionId=a15V400000NnvcbIAB\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"28305\" data-permalink=\"https://sjcc.org/programs/fitness/co-ed-softball/register-now-250x47/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/sjcc.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/ab188-register-now-250x47.jpg?fit=250%2C47&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"250,47\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Register-Now-250&amp;#215;47\" data-image-description=\"&lt;p&gt;Blue Register Now Button&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/sjcc.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/ab188-register-now-250x47.jpg?fit=250%2C47&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-28305\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/sjcc.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/ab188-register-now-250x47.jpg?resize=250%2C47&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Register Now Button\" width=\"250\" height=\"47\" /></a></p>\n<p>If you have your own yoga mat, please bring it with you.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
