      "id": 151865,
      "url": "https://sjcc.org/event/sjcc-book-club-heaven-and-earth-grocery-store/",
      "title": "SJCC Book Club: “Heaven and Earth Grocery Store”",
      "description": "<p>Multicultural Book Discussion: The Heaven &amp; Earth Grocery Store</p>\n<p>Join the SJCC Book Club and King County Library System (KCLS) for a special multicultural discussion of James McBride’s acclaimed novel, “The Heaven &amp; Earth Grocery Store.”</p>\n<p>Set in a diverse Pennsylvania neighborhood in the 1930s, the novel brings together Jewish immigrants and African American residents in a powerful story of community, identity, belonging, prejudice, and the courage to care for one another across cultural differences.</p>\n<p>Share your thoughts and perspectives as we explore the book’s themes and consider what this story can teach us about building community across differences, both then and today.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://form.jotform.com/262444524389969\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"28305\" data-permalink=\"https://sjcc.org/programs/fitness/co-ed-softball/register-now-250x47/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/sjcc.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/ab188-register-now-250x47.jpg?fit=250%2C47&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"250,47\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Register-Now-250&amp;#215;47\" data-image-description=\"&lt;p&gt;Blue Register Now Button&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/sjcc.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/ab188-register-now-250x47.jpg?fit=250%2C47&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-28305\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/sjcc.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/ab188-register-now-250x47.jpg?resize=250%2C47&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Register Now Button\" width=\"250\" height=\"47\" /></a></p>",
